  "question": {
    "text": "Time periods of oscillation of the same simple pendulum measured using four different measuring clocks were recorded as $4.62 \\mathrm{~s}, 4.632 \\mathrm{~s}, 4.6 \\mathrm{~s}$ and $4.64 \\mathrm{~s}$. The arithmetic mean of these readings in correct significant figure is :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
