  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Sum of number by considering significant digi\n$\\text {sum }=4.6+4.6+4.6+4.6=18.4$\nArithmetic Mean $=\\frac{\\text { sum }}{4}=\\frac{18.4}{4}=4.6$",
